          "Escalate an item that has waited past the written threshold. A case with no next action is an exception even if it says in progress. Name the owner for every open item, including items waiting on someone else. Log the handoff time when a case crosses a shift. For extension notice coverage, compare the request record with the destination value rather than relying on a status label. Closing Specialist treats an undocumented the request record as an open closing condition, not as a cleared item."
